    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the wild and war-torn realm of <strong>Eldenwood</strong>, a land gripped by tyranny, temptation, and ancient power. In <strong>DragonStone Revenge</strong>, you play as <strong>Myranda</strong>, a fierce and cunning warrior maiden with a mysterious past and a blade sharpened by vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/86e453c5a352bb60bccc79b3c7dad2a5.poster.avif?t=1753378301\" width=602 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/86e453c5a352bb60bccc79b3c7dad2a5.webm?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/86e453c5a352bb60bccc79b3c7dad2a5.mp4?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raised in the shadows of King\u2019s Landing and exiled by betrayal, Myranda returns to a fractured world\u2014one ruled by corrupt nobles, dark rituals, and creatures born from forgotten magic. As the last living heir to a legendary bloodline, she alone can unlock the power of the <strong>DragonStone</strong>, a mythical artifact said to control the fate of the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But power comes with a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/c6d6e5edef915e0f369d44a492c8e09b.poster.avif?t=1753378301\" width=602 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/c6d6e5edef915e0f369d44a492c8e09b.webm?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/c6d6e5edef915e0f369d44a492c8e09b.mp4?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Mature, Story-Driven Gameplay</strong><br>Make bold choices in a rich, branching narrative filled with betrayal, seduction, revenge, and redemption. Every decision Myranda makes changes her relationships\u2014and the outcome of the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Expansive Open World</strong><br>From the cursed ruins of Hollowshade to the decadent halls of Goldspire Keep, explore dozens of hand-crafted locations teeming with secrets, side quests, and dangerous beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/2a36db3bf7ca8b3c4013a1b121fe9191.poster.avif?t=1753378301\" width=602 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/2a36db3bf7ca8b3c4013a1b121fe9191.webm?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/2a36db3bf7ca8b3c4013a1b121fe9191.mp4?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Combat System</strong><br>Master a fluid and deadly combat system that blends swordplay, stealth, and forbidden magic. Upgrade your abilities and forge unique gear as you battle beasts, traitors, and tyrants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f <strong>Romance &amp; Intrigue</strong><br>Forge alliances or manipulate them. Choose your lovers wisely\u2014noble knights, rogue witches, and dangerous enemies await. Intimacy opens doors\u2026 and sometimes traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/3cef949342653741124aba4264e63fcd.poster.avif?t=1753378301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/3cef949342653741124aba4264e63fcd.webp?t=1753378301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=603 height=108 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc09 <strong>Unleash the Dragon Within</strong><br>Awaken the legacy buried in Myranda\u2019s blood. As the DragonStone begins to respond to her will, a darker, more powerful side of her is revealed. Will you control it\u2014or be consumed by it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOT JUST A FIGHT FOR SURVIVAL\u2026 </strong><br> <strong>IT'S A FIGHT TO CLAIM YOUR DESTINY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Myranda\u2019s revenge has just begun. Are you ready to light the fire?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <i>Coming soon. Wishlist now and prepare to enter Eldenwood.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the wild and war-torn realm of <strong>Eldenwood</strong>, a land gripped by tyranny, temptation, and ancient power. In <strong>DragonStone Revenge</strong>, you play as <strong>Myranda</strong>, a fierce and cunning warrior maiden with a mysterious past and a blade sharpened by vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/86e453c5a352bb60bccc79b3c7dad2a5.poster.avif?t=1753378301\" width=602 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/86e453c5a352bb60bccc79b3c7dad2a5.webm?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/86e453c5a352bb60bccc79b3c7dad2a5.mp4?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raised in the shadows of King\u2019s Landing and exiled by betrayal, Myranda returns to a fractured world\u2014one ruled by corrupt nobles, dark rituals, and creatures born from forgotten magic. As the last living heir to a legendary bloodline, she alone can unlock the power of the <strong>DragonStone</strong>, a mythical artifact said to control the fate of the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But power comes with a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/c6d6e5edef915e0f369d44a492c8e09b.poster.avif?t=1753378301\" width=602 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/c6d6e5edef915e0f369d44a492c8e09b.webm?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/c6d6e5edef915e0f369d44a492c8e09b.mp4?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Mature, Story-Driven Gameplay</strong><br>Make bold choices in a rich, branching narrative filled with betrayal, seduction, revenge, and redemption. Every decision Myranda makes changes her relationships\u2014and the outcome of the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Expansive Open World</strong><br>From the cursed ruins of Hollowshade to the decadent halls of Goldspire Keep, explore dozens of hand-crafted locations teeming with secrets, side quests, and dangerous beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/2a36db3bf7ca8b3c4013a1b121fe9191.poster.avif?t=1753378301\" width=602 height=108 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/2a36db3bf7ca8b3c4013a1b121fe9191.webm?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/2a36db3bf7ca8b3c4013a1b121fe9191.mp4?t=1753378301\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Combat System</strong><br>Master a fluid and deadly combat system that blends swordplay, stealth, and forbidden magic. Upgrade your abilities and forge unique gear as you battle beasts, traitors, and tyrants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2764\ufe0f <strong>Romance &amp; Intrigue</strong><br>Forge alliances or manipulate them. Choose your lovers wisely\u2014noble knights, rogue witches, and dangerous enemies await. Intimacy opens doors\u2026 and sometimes traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/3cef949342653741124aba4264e63fcd.poster.avif?t=1753378301\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763260/extras/3cef949342653741124aba4264e63fcd.webp?t=1753378301\" class=\"bb_img\" width=603 height=108 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc09 <strong>Unleash the Dragon Within</strong><br>Awaken the legacy buried in Myranda\u2019s blood. As the DragonStone begins to respond to her will, a darker, more powerful side of her is revealed. Will you control it\u2014or be consumed by it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOT JUST A FIGHT FOR SURVIVAL\u2026 </strong><br> <strong>IT'S A FIGHT TO CLAIM YOUR DESTINY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Myranda\u2019s revenge has just begun. Are you ready to light the fire?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <i>Coming soon. Wishlist now and prepare to enter Eldenwood.</i></p>",
